{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026wxqg64GFuG1792855626.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中環蘭桂坊連續第二個周末舉行萬聖節巡遊，氣氛相當熱鬧，現場人頭湧湧，不少人悉心打扮到場。</p><p></p><p>警方晚上九時半實施人潮管制，市民及遊客不可在德己立街停留，士丹利街、威靈頓街一帶亦有管制，部分地方封路。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T16:40:29.016539+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":97,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T15:24:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-25T02:18:05.872944+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T16:38:09.509497+00:00","content_hash":"860f950710c0153f6f03dff9cad47e978fe7e7efddb97afc8a0f86d477764a05","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}